    "page": 1,
    "asset": "chapter7_q_judge_read1",
    "memory": "cp7_main_q_judge_read1",
    "title": "叁 · 对抗",
    "text": "你们冲进周总办公室。但朱老师没来。",
    "contextBefore": "scene boundary",
    "contextAfter": "没有朱老师那句话，版权撤销就不成立。",
