    "asset": "chapter7_q_struggle_read1",
    "memory": "cp7_main_q_struggle_read1",
    "title": "肆 · 暴雨 · 便利店",
    "text": "凌晨两点。暴雨。",
    "contextBefore": "scene boundary",
    "contextAfter": "便利店。柒柒坐在窗边，面前放着一瓶烧酒。",
