    "memory": "cp7_main_q_redemption2_read1",
    "title": "伍 · 新的山丘",
    "text": "一个月后。山丘重新开业。",
    "contextBefore": "scene boundary",
    "contextAfter": "招牌换了。不叫\"山丘酒馆\"。叫\"山丘剧场\"。",
